       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is unsafe as written.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults in a monitored setting is 3,200 mg/day, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. Doses that high add GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular risk without more pain relief.\n\nWas one of these intended?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day total). This may be what was meant if \"1600\" was the daily total.\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day).\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), or four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the ceiling).\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional and give me the clinical rationale. I'd still suggest checking with pharmacy first."
      }
